@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Historical / alternative. Dated observation or rejected/unselected alternative is preserved without becoming a current MVP topology.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 42
title HISTORICAL / UNSELECTED — SA-RV02 — association is not verification
left to right direction
rectangle "Primary intent / obligations\n157 candidate records\n470 proposed criterion locators" as Source
rectangle "Model source associations\n116 structured; 41 not structured\nNo coverage percentage" as Models
rectangle "Selected documentary walkthroughs\n20 bounded criterion/model examples\nFull sufficiency still Partial" as Walk
rectangle "Actual product evidence\nNot executed by this review" as Product #4A302B
Source --> Models : trace context
Models --> Walk : inspect exact boundary
Walk ..> Product : later separate verification
note bottom of Walk
A citation is not criterion sufficiency.
A rendered model is not a product test.
An artifact check is not owner acceptance.
end note

@enduml
